<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-14T23:15:46.627Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:15:46 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have deployed troops to Jurf al-Sakhr and dismissed nine Babil officials amid a probe into oil-smuggling linked to Iran-backed militias, while a new special security force and an energy police unit have been created to protect pipelines. Iran-backed suspects are planning attacks on the U.K. air base that hosts U.S. jets in Iraq and are tied to a drone strike that disabled the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan. A militia commander plotted an attack on the base from a Brooklyn jail, and a militia leader labeled Iraq’s first Jewish heritage museum a national security threat. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/11/13/trump-falsely-claims-nobodys-been-killed-iran-war-last-five-months/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQaW52UFA1Vko1QnlJWFMwdUhFc2F0Q21oc3R2Vno2VzRWdF9jejBNcXZ1eVh0eUNsTHJVLUhjR3lseUdrVU1sMGlyN2gyaVhhdWVWRXdSZWdxdk0zTi0tQy0xaTNPdV9mYzZSU1NrSXNUM0F4RURoREgxeWNWRTA2NG5uZXdIazNCeVVQZk84QkxjRFNaaEM5dXV4d1hRQzVOOWxZTHdyT1JEMTd3eHgwSV9DTXA5WGxGUTRXRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab Times Kuwait News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNb3FpeDJZdko3dEZKV2VrYkVkMmNVcTltcVcwUnMzZ1RmOXJwNllDN2pyQjdfV2h3dURYeWhYX0ZwMTQweGZOUGRSZDRrc05tZURJUng0VU50dFZTVlJWVGx4dmhwQmRIa19SWXBfTlJndjlTVzMtZ25vMHFrZW5tRFpZR29sQVhIUjRDRWJHM2NtaVBVWHdZRHY3SHhIU25hcnNqdlQyUDE?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQMm5NWVJmdGdVaEZtNHJ3czBQUWJtRnBRZ3p4LWhCeHBoTFFJZW8xT29DVGctWXYwb3Y2UVNWVHJKQVc0VkItRXdHLUMyeE5FLUhucjhkQ20xTFg5em5xWWhYUUIxVXM0NEUybTMzencyaXRuRG5hRTN0MkZWVGdN